# Wings of Gold (jeuno 60), check 1's Path operand alone: a level 40 BST (the harness's char job, no unlock) with Save My
# Son completed and Path of the Beastmaster not completed. No Wings of Gold section; Path of the Beastmaster's
# available section answers Brutus (70, Progress).
lists UpperJeuno/Brutus/onTrigger
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-55.5,8.2,97.5 job=BST lvl=40
quest Jeuno.ChocoboOnTheLoose completed
